{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Kanji Finder 是一款結合漢字字典與學習功能的日文學習工具，適合備考 JLPT N2、溫習教育漢字的學習者使用。查詢過的漢字可儲存成清單，並自動轉化為單字卡與測驗。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-16.webp\">\n<h2>漢字查詢與記憶練習</h2>\n<p>應用支援以日文、羅馬字或英文搜尋 1,235 個漢字，涵蓋全部教育漢字及 JLPT N2 常用字。每個字附筆順與筆畫數、音讀與訓讀發音、示例詞語，以及年級與 Kodansha、Classic Nelson 參照。儲存的漢字可製成單字卡，配合間隔重複自動安排複習，並以多種題型測驗；主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具會顯示待複習數量。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-52-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-53-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-54-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-55-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-56-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-57-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Kanji Finder: Flashcards</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T22:39:15.428678+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:23:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:35.473993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T22:37:48.314370+00:00","content_hash":"47449b957da61791d60f4ee56ea8dc5ce75489b955e68918a126f9f51d14ec9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}